%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Urchin
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 4
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Spike Barrage
    AbilityDescription: Free spikes in every direction, which steal every prism they
      land on - including other players' trails. Charge is the DEPTH of the chain
      reaction - how many further generations a landed spike may spray - and it also
      feeds the ammo the aimed volley spends. At level 5 the free barrage chains too.
    Input: 2
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 2
    MinMultiplier: 0.4
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Overcharge
    UpgradeDescription: The barrage's spikes chain. At base they steal wide and stop;
      overcharged, every one of them sprays a further generation, so a single free
      press can convert a whole neighbourhood instead of a shell of it.
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Trail Rider
    AbilityDescription: Fly into a trail to latch onto it and ride, steering by the
      ribbon rather than the stick. Your own trail GROWS under you as you pass;
      an enemy's is STOLEN. Riding also recharges ammo, at double rate over shielded
      prisms. Mass is how much volume each friendly prism gains per pass. Passive -
      it triggers on contact, not on a button.
    Input: 0
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Reinforced Wake
    UpgradeDescription: Prisms you grow while riding arrive shielded. Since a shielded
      prism pays double ammo to ride over, a fortified lap of your own trail funds
      the next one.
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Spike Volley
    AbilityDescription: An aimed burst of spikes. Each one embeds in the prism it
      hits, steals it, and sprays the next generation out of the mass it just took -
      a cascade that runs for as long as it keeps finding enemy territory, and dies
      when it runs out. Space is REACH - how far each spike flies, carried down every
      generation of the chain. At level 5 the cascade stops losing reach as it spreads.
    Input: 1
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 2.5
    MinMultiplier: 0.4
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Deep Cascade
    UpgradeDescription: The chain stops decaying. Normally each generation launches
      shorter than the one before it, so a deep cascade peters out; with this, the
      last generation reaches as far as the first.
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Slip
    AbilityDescription: Let go of the trail you are riding and phase out for a moment,
      so you can clear the mass you were inside instead of being re-latched by it.
      Time is how long the ghost lasts. At level 5 hostile trail no longer slows you
      down, so raiding an enemy ribbon is as fast as riding your own.
    Input: 7
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Slipstream
    UpgradeDescription: Enemy trail is ridden at your friendly speed. Hostile mass
      normally crawls, which punishes the raid exactly when you most want to be
      moving; overcharged, you cross it at full pace while still converting it.
